&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize foundational, high-leverage datasets that power business-critical applications including analytics, machine learning, experimentation, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish metrics governance and a robust semantic layer that serves as the foundation for both traditional analytics tools and AI-powered data experiences, creating a single source of truth that enables accurate insights whether accessed through dashboards or natural language queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen a world-class data engineering team, expanding the impact and reach of data across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative culture that thrives on innovation, impact, and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
