&lt;li&gt;5+ years of management experience, having successfully hired and grown other managers and&amp;nbsp; technical leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of cross-functional collaboration with data science, ML, and engineering teams to optimize data pipelines and consumption patterns for usability, performance, and cost—working end-to-end from instrumentation to insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on expertise with modern data storage and processing technologies (BigQuery, SQL, Airflow, Dagster, dbt, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization and dashboarding technologies (Looker, Tableau, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and scaling semantic/metrics layers (using tools like dbt metrics, Looker LookML, or similar) that enable reliable insights through both dashboards and AI-powered experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building self-service analytics capabilities and data products that democratize data access and empowering non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills across technical and non-technical audiences, with an ability to explain complex concepts clearly and influence at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating ambiguity, solving problems that are not well-defined and adapting as priorities evolve quickly&lt;/li&gt;
